        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Second Hand Dances for the Crude, Crude City  Gerry Morita   This work is inspired by Chi Pig, the lead vocalist of Edmonton's greatest punk band ever, SNFU. These dances explore what it means to be punk or alternative in today's world, when the meaning behind those terms has become commodified, fas"
